schema NarrationAssembly
owner cmd/BonfyreBroadcast/src/narration_assembly.h
generation narration-assembly-1

field sample_rate
  type integer
  required true

field clips
  type ordered-array
  required true

invariant content-addressed-takes
  statement each take is verified against its SHA-256 before and after rendering

invariant bounded-sequence
  statement at most 64 non-overlapping clips span at most 600 seconds at one verified sample rate

forbidden_inference a valid assembly plan -> reviewed narration, music rights or publication authority
